  "Daniela, a grade 10 student born in Queens, speaks Spanish fluently with her family but has never been taught to read or write it; her spoken Spanish is informal, with little academic vocabulary. She wants to take Spanish at school and eventually earn the NYS Seal of Biliteracy. Which placement and instruction would best serve her?",
